  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br />On solving, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Also,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />This gives,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
